Some Important Commands in Docker 

➡️List containers - docker ps -a

➡️Logs - docker logs <container>

➡️Inspect - docker inspect <container>

➡️Exec inside - docker exec -it <container> sh

➡️Disk usage - docker system df

➡️Remove stopped containers - docker container prune

➡️Remove unused images - docker image prune -a

➡️Remove volumes (careful) - docker volume prune

➡️Full cleanup - docker system prune -a
